  m_text: "\u2022<indent=20>Heavy and slow, with a short hop</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Smashes cracked words, presses periods</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Squashes an enemy by landing on it</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Shoots bigger asterisks</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Snaps hyphen bridges and breaks commas</indent>"
